    </ParagraphLine>
    <ParagraphLine TextAlignment="Left" TextType="Normal" BlockID="33ff50e8-4ead-4556-aea3-91e600fdfa66">
      <Normal>
        <Normal>
          <Normal>A dying Egyptian laborer whose country was dragged into a white man's war, forced to work for the british army, screams his last words as he meets his demise.</Normal>
        </Normal>
      </Normal>
    </ParagraphLine>
    <ParagraphLine TextAlignment="Left" TextType="Normal" BlockID="10ac2cce-413e-48ac-be7c-27a4909002f8">
      <Normal>
        <Normal>
          <Normal>Btw, I noticed you keep nitpicking my work, and I don't like that. Do you know what? screw you. This is my project and I do what I want. Here's a Mahshi recipe.</Normal>
        </Normal>
      </Normal>
    </ParagraphLine>
